      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1905-03-25_WidnesExaminer_art0044" n="art0044">
        <head>' NORTHERN UNION CUP.</head>
        <p>' NORTHERN UNION CUP.</p>
        <p>SECOND ROUND.</p>
        <p>RESULTS AT A GLANCE.</p>
        <p>Bradford Oldham *Huddersfield *Broughton Rangers lB St. Helens *Warrington 3 Keighley *Hull Kingston Rovers... 3 Leeds Hunslet 7 *Hull 5</p>
