        <head>Deaths.</head>
        <p>Deaths.</p>
        <p>YATES—March 19th, at York-street, Warrington, Mart Yates, aged 66 years. Cocxxx—March 20th, at Aiken-street, Warrington, Thomas Cockin, aged 50 years. REEVES—March 21s, at Mitchell-street, Warringterl, Thomas Reeves, aged 69 years.</p>
